  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marine spatial planning in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to accelerate progress in sustainable marine development in the context of climate change at a national and provincial level in Viet Nam. The project&apos;s objectives include:(i) accelerating progress in Marine Spatial Planning with a focus on promotion of science and technology transfer and marine-related innovation; (ii) implementing integrated spatial planning promoting marine sustainable development in one site in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
